# Privacy Policy for App Lock Pro

Last Updated: July 2026

App Lock Pro ("the App") respects your privacy and is committed to protecting your personal information.

## Information We Collect

App Lock Pro does not collect, store, or share personal information such as your name, email address, contacts, messages, photos, or files.

The App may use the following permissions solely to provide its core functionality:

### Accessibility Service

App Lock Pro uses Accessibility Service to detect when protected applications are opened and to display the lock screen for those applications.

Accessibility data is processed locally on your device and is not transmitted, collected, stored, or shared with any third party.

### Usage Access Permission

The App uses Usage Access Permission to identify the currently active application and enforce app locking features.

This information remains on your device and is never transmitted to external servers.

### Storage

If enabled, the App may store security settings, lock preferences, and protected application lists locally on your device.

## Advertising

App Lock Pro may display advertisements through trusted advertising providers such as Google AdMob.

Advertising providers may collect limited information in accordance with their own privacy policies.

## Data Sharing

App Lock Pro does not sell, rent, or share personal information with third parties.

## Security

We take reasonable measures to protect application settings and information stored locally on your device.

## Children's Privacy

App Lock Pro is not directed toward children under the age of 13.

## Changes to This Policy

We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. Any updates will be posted on this page.

